@startuml
title Plane Lifecycle

state "Order" as Order
state "Arrival" as Arrival
state "Preparation" as Preparation
state "Operations" as Operations
state "Maintenance" as Maintenance
state "Out of Service" as OutOfService

[*] --> Order : New Plane Acquired

Arrival --> Preparation : Plane Arrived

Preparation --> Operations : Condition Met /\nSchedule Available
Preparation --> Maintenance : Condition Not Met /\nSchedule Unavailable

Operations --> Maintenance : No Scheduled Flights /\nMaintenance Required

Maintenance --> Preparation : Checked and Serviced

Preparation --> Operations : Condition Met /\nSchedule Available

Operations --> OutOfService : Permanently Withdrawn

[*] --> Order
@enduml
